      <h3>Safety first</h3>
      <p>All volunteers complete a background check to keep members safe.</p>
      <p><strong>Suggested donation:</strong> $30 one-time screening + $10 annual update. If the fee is a barrier, let us know—we still want you on the team.</p>
    </div>
