      <ul class="list">
        <li>Provide rides to appointments or WPV events</li>
        <li>Friendly visits and check-in calls</li>
        <li>Light errands and small chores</li>
        <li>Tech help (phones, tablets, streaming)</li>
        <li>Host or support social gatherings</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h3>What you get</h3>
      <p>Training, support from staff, and invitations to WPV socials and community events. Most volunteers choose one or two roles that fit their schedule.</p>
